  "prefLabel": "Plc 1601.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1601.01 Purpose. The purpose of this chapter is to implement RSA 326-M relative to nurse agency registration, by establishing requirements for:\n\n(a) Registering with the office of professional licensure and certification (OPLC) as a nurse agency; and\n\n(b) Renewing a nurse agency registration.\n\nSource. #13914, eff 5-6-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1600.html"
